04)------Projection: t_s_firstyear.customer_id, t_s_secyear.customer_id, t_s_secyear.customer_first_name, t_s_secyear.customer_last_name, t_s_secyear.customer_preferred_cust_flag, t_c_firstyear.year_total, t_c_secyear.year_total, t_w_firstyear.year_total
